// Title: UAC Bypass Using MSConfig Token Modification - File
// Sigma ID: 41bb431f-56d8-4691-bb56-ed34e390906f
// Status: test | Level: high
// Author: Christian Burkard (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2021-08-30 | Modified: 2022-10-09
// ATT&CK: privilege-escalation, T1548.002
// Description: Detects the pattern of UAC Bypass using a msconfig GUI hack (UACMe 55)
// False positives:
//   - Unknown
// References:
//   - https://github.com/hfiref0x/UACME
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/05d1031f537e830b76da53bae2400c5814c89165/rules/windows/file/file_event/file_event_win_uac_bypass_msconfig_gui.yml
